Package: kidux-webapps
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         chromium,
         chromium-l10n,
         python3,
         python3-kidux (>= 0.1.26),
Description: Kidux web applications, for learning modules made of web pages
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This package is
 what learning modules made of web pages need: a small server that serves
 them on this computer only, and Chromium, opened on one of them at a time
 in a window with no tabs and no address bar, and held by a managed policy
 to that server and nothing else, so a link out of a learning module leads
 nowhere.
 .
 The policy applies to every use of Chromium on this computer.
